                text: 'Two or more players.',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Standard Spanish 40-card pack (four suits: oros, espadas, copas, bastos). In Tute subastado the twos are set aside and 36 cards are used; 12 cards are dealt to each player.',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Cards',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'As Tute; then auction',
              },
            ],
