          origins: 'Tute originated in Italy as tutti and spread to Spain in the 19th century, becoming one of the most popular card games there. Tute subastado is the auction variant: trump is not determined by a turned card but by a round of bidding; the highest bidder becomes soloist and chooses trump, and must make at least the number of points bid.',
